#* {{quote-book|en|year=2016|author=David Chan|title=Enabling Positive Attitudes and Experiences in Singapore|page=140|passage="Conversely, just because I am not '''high''' on positivity, it does not mean I am necessarily '''high''' on negativity."}}
#* '''2010''', Lena, quoted by S. Rosenbloom, ''The Multiracial Urban High School: Fearing Peers and Trusting Friends'' ({{ISBN|0230114733}}), chapter four:
