#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Jeph Jacques|title=w:Questionable Content|format=webcomic|year=2018|section=3879: Pointy Boi|sectionurl=https://questionablecontent.net/view.php?comic=3879|text="Three extremely '''high''' people showing up at the animal shelter like WE FOUND A DOG would be really funny, but..."}}
#* {{quote-av|en|date=20 June 2025|author=Gooseworx|actor=w:Michael Kovach|role=Jax|episode=Untitled|title=w:The Amazing Digital Circus|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=L4p2gN2CzsA|number=5|time=16:00|text=Ooh!  Remember when you got '''high''' at McDonald's and told Gangle to kill herself?}}
